        "text": "noncomputable def momentMatrix (P : Patch) (a : Fin n → ℝ) := LocalizedMomentRepair.matrix a (lower P) (upper P); its action is `matrixEquiv_apply` (line 221): matrixEquiv P a ha c i = ∫ x, x ^ a i * correction P c x, i.e. the entries are ∫ x^{a i} β_j"
